        <detaileddescription>
<para><hruler/>
</para>
<para>Analysis of steady-state fluid pressure and velocity distributions in fractured medium using quadratic FEM.</para>
<para>Post-processing of the streamfunction that can be contoured to get streamlines.</para>
<para><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_example" kindref="compound">Example</ref> also allows to vary the permeability of model subregions (addressed by their name) and calculates its effective permeability.</para>
<para>Try &apos;example21.1&apos; input file set. </para>
